  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - Within the context of the planning permission P/4531/20 dated 29/03/2021, the proposed development would be materially different in its massing, design, and would conflict with an extant condition on the approved application. This results in a material change to the character and appearance of the host dwelling, street scene and wider area, and would also result in a material change in impact on the residential amenities of adjoining neighbours. It would therefore require re-consultation of neighbouring properties, and the proposal would need to be re-assessed against the requirements of Policy D3 of The London Plan (2021) and Policy DM1 of the Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010). The proposal is therefore not considered to be non-material minor amendment."
